{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35645","headline":"禅林寺作寄刘书记 · 李山甫","name":"禅林寺作寄刘书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐近松风骨自寒，茅斋直拶白云边。\n玄关不闭何人到，此事谁论在佛先。\n天竺老师留一句，曹溪行者答全篇。\n今朝林下忘言说，强把新诗寄谪仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}